OL,3,Vupppppp5CTuesday
OL,5,G0300 Inside the Asylum Camp
OL,6,     FMass accommodation sites are
OL,7,     Fcentral to the Government's plan
OL,8,     Fto end the use of asylum hotels
OL,9,     Fand this undercover investigation
OL,10,     Fgoes inside Crowborough, a former
OL,11,     Fmilitary training camp in East
OL,12,     FSussex now housing asylum seekers.
OL,13,     FThe programme investigates
OL,14,     Fconditions inside the site,
OL,15,     Ffinding how systemically poor
OL,16,     Fwelfare checks are having serious
OL,17,     Fconsequences, and also examines
OL,18,     Fthe local community's response to
OL,19,     Fasylum seekers being housed in the
OL,20,     Ftown
